  "historyNote": "(See Revision Note #1 at Chapter Heading He-W 600) #5171, eff 6-26-91; ss by #6446, eff 2-1-97; amd by #7192, eff 2-1-00; ss by #7470, eff 4-1-01; paragraph (a) amd by #8740, INTERIM, eff 10-13-06, EXPIRED: 4-11-07; paragraph (a) amd by #8869, eff 4-19-07; ss by #9123, eff 4-3-08; ss by #9275, eff 9-20-08; ss by #10163, eff 7-26-12",
